WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:09.070
Returns: return, exchange and warranty requests customers send in DMs, with photos or video of the item.

2
00:00:09.624 --> 00:00:14.210
Open the request and look at the reason and "Customer's photos / video".

3
00:00:14.765 --> 00:00:19.980
Decide by your return rule and change the status; the customer is told.

4
00:00:20.533 --> 00:00:30.640
When the item arrives, set the status to "Item received"; if "Put returned items back in stock" is on in the shipping settings, it goes back into stock.

5
00:00:31.185 --> 00:00:36.660
Before refusing, check the photos closely and write the reason for the customer.
